(9.1 Signal Chain) Tj T*
(The signal chain consists of a colli-mated source, a dichro-ic beam splitter and a) Tj T*
(mono-chromator feeding a cooled detec-tor. Each stage is described in turn below.) Tj T*
(The colli-mated source reduces the beam divergence before the first optic.) Tj T*
(Beam splitting is performed by a dichro-ic element at forty-five degrees.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
