(5.1 Noise Characteristics) Tj T*
(Thermal noise dominates below the detector's threshold and cannot be calibrated away.) Tj T*
(Shot noise scales with the square root of the exposure time at low flux.) Tj T*
(Both sources are reported separately rather than combined into one figure.) Tj T*
(Combining them would hide which one dominates under the conditions that matter.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
